#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game type: Strategy, Board"
msgstr "Tip igre: Strategija, Ploča"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kfourinline; is a board game for two players based on the "
"<trademark>Connect-Four</trademark> game."
msgstr ""
"&kfourinline; je igra na ploči za dva igrača bazirana na <trademark>Spoji-"
"četiri</trademark> igri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The players try to build up a row of four pieces using different strategies. "
"Pieces are placed on a board. The game can also be played against a computer."
msgstr ""
"Igrači pokušavaju stvoriti red od četiri komada, koristeći različite "
"strategije. Komadi su postavljeni na ploču. Igra se također može igrati i "
"protiv kompjutera."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &kfourinline; loads, you can select the difficulty or start a two "
"player game. If you like, you can also pick your color and select which "
"color starts the game."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &kfourinline; učita, možete odabrati težinu ili započeti igru sa dva "
"igrača. Ako želite, također možete odabrati svoju boju i označiti koja boja "
"započinje igru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each player is represented by a color (for example yellow or white for "
"player one and red for player two). The goal of the game is to get four "
"connected pieces of your color into any row, column or diagonal. The players "
"move in turns. Each turn the player can place one of his or her pieces into "
"any of the seven columns where each piece will fall to the lowest possible "
"free place &ie; it will fall down until it reaches the ground level or "
"another piece."
msgstr ""
"Svaki igrač je predstavljen bojom (naprimjer žuta ili bijela za prvog igrača "
"i crvena za drugog igrača). Cilj igre je spojiti četiri komadića svoje boje "
"u bilo kojem redu, koloni ili dijagonali. Igrači igraju naizmjenično. Svaki "
"put igrač može staviti jedan od svojih komadića u bilo koju od sedam kolona, "
"gdje će svaki komadić pasti do najnižeg mogućeg slobodnog mjesta &ie; past "
"će dole sve dok ne dotakne najniži nivo ili drugi komadić."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After one player's move is done the second player can make his or her input. "
"This is repeated until the game is over, which is when one of the players "
"has four pieces in a row, column or diagonal or no more moves are possible "
"because the board is filled."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je jedan igrač napravio potez, drugi igrač može napraviti svoj. "
"Ovo se ponavlja sve dok se igra ne završi, a to se dešava kada jedan od "
"igrača ima četiri komada u redu, koloni ili dijagonali, ili je ploča "
"popunjena i nema više mogućih poteza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A player who first manages to get four pieces in a row, column or diagonal "
"wins the game. If no more moves can be made but no player has won, the game "
"ends drawn."
msgstr ""
"Igrač koji prvi uspije složiti četiri komada u redu, koloni ili dijagonali, "
"pobjeđuje. Ako nema više poteza na raspolaganju, a nijedan igrač nije "
"pobjedio, igra se završava neriješeno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game rules, strategies and tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "The board is separated into several regions."
msgstr "Ploča je podijeljena u nekoliko regija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <firstterm>game board</firstterm> is constructed out of 7x6 fields which "
"will be filled from bottom to top. The fields are marked with pieces in the "
"color of the player who made the move to this position. On top of each "
"column a colored arrow shows were the last piece had been put."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>ploča za igru</firstterm> je izgrađena od 7x6 polja koji će biti "
"popunjeni od dna od vrha. Polja su označena komadićima boje igrača koji je "
"napravio potez do te pozicije. Na vrhu svake kolone, obojena strelica "
"pokazuje gdje je bio smješten zadnji komadić."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <firstterm>status display</firstterm> shows which player is controlled "
"by which input device. A local player can input moves using keyboard or "
"mouse, a remote player is shown as network input and finally the computer "
"can control the input for a player. The status display further shows the "
"player's names and the level of the computer opponent. Additionally the "
"number of won, drawn, lost and ended games is noted for both players. Which "
"player is next to move is indicated by one of the player's names being "
"highlighted."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>prikaz statusa</firstterm> pokazuje koji igrač upravlja kojim "
"ulaznim uređajem. Lokalni igrač može igrati koristeći tastaturu ili miš, "
"udaljeni igrač može koristiti mrežni ulazni uređaj, i na kraju, računar može "
"upravljati ulazom za igrača. Prikaz statusa dodatno prikazuje imena igrača i "
"nivo računara kao protivnika. Pored toga, broj osvojenih, izjednačenih i "
"izgubljenih igara zabilježen je za oba igrača. Koji je igrač slijedeći na "
"potezu, označeno je isticanjem imena igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <firstterm>statusbar</firstterm> at the bottom of the screen displays "
"the status of the game and which player is next to play."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>traka stanja</firstterm> na dnu ekrana prikazuje stanje igre i "
"koji igrač je slijedeći na redu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remote Connections"
msgstr "Udaljeno povezivanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to play the game over a network connection with another "
"computer. One of the computers will act as game server. This one can "
"determine who should play which color. You can configure the network options "
"in the menu <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Network "
"Configuration...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. In the menu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Network Chat...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. you find a chat dialog box which allows you to "
"speak with your friend."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je igrati igru preko mrežne veze sa drugim računarom. Jedan od "
"računara će se ponašati kao poslužitelj igre. Taj može odrediti ko će igrati "
"sa kojom bojom. Možete konfigurisati mrežne opcije u izborniku "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguracija mreže...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. U izborniku  <menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Ćaskanje putem mreže...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"pronaći ćete prozor sa dijalogom za ćaskanje koji vam omogućava da "
"razgovarate sa svojim prijateljem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a network connection is built you will be asked to enter a remote host "
"and a port. The port can usually just be left untouched, but if you know "
"what you are doing replace it by another number, which has to be the same in "
"both player games of course. The hostname should be the name of the remote "
"host to which you are connecting. Only the client in the connection has to "
"supply a hostname. It is often wise that the player behind a firewall "
"chooses to be client as the firewall might not allow incoming connections."
msgstr ""
"Kada je izgrađena mrežna veza, od vas će se tražiti da unesete udaljeni host "
"i port. Port obično možete ostaviti netaknut, ali ako znate šta radite, "
"zamijenite ga s drugim brojem, koji naravno mora biti isti za oba igrača "
"igre. Ime hosta bi trebalo biti ime udaljenog hosta prema kojem se spajate. "
"Samo klijent u ovoj vezi mora popuniti ime hosta. Često je mudro da igrač "
"iza zaštitnog zida izabere da bude klijent, pošto zaštitni zid možda neće "
"dozvoliti dolazne veze."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "Pregled izgleda igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "Opcije menija"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts a new game. In a network game this option is only available for the "
"network server. The network client will be automatically started by the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Započinje novu igru. U mrežnoj igri, ova opcija je dostupna samo za mrežni "
"poslužitelj. Mrežni klijent će automatski započeti preko poslužitelja."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Load...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Učitaj...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loads a saved game."
msgstr "Učitava spremljenu igru."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Snimi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the current game."
msgstr "Snima trenutnu igru."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>End</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>End Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Kraj</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Završi igru</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ends a running game."
msgstr "Završava pokrenutu igru."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Network Chat...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ćaskanje putem mreže...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pops up a chat widget which allows you to send messages to the other party."
msgstr ""
"Iskoči alatka za ćaskanje koja vam dozvoljava da šaljete poruke drugoj "
"strani."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Statistics</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži statistiku</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows a dialog containing information about the overall game statistics, "
"that is games won, lost or drawn by both players. The dialog also allows to "
"clear this all time statistics."
msgstr ""
"Pokazuje dijalog koji sadrži informacije o cjelokupnoj statistici igre, to "
"jest o dobivenim igrama, izgubljenim ili nerješenim od strane oba igrača. "
"Dijalog također omogućava brisanje statistike od početka."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izlaz</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quits the program."
msgstr "Izlazi iz programa."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Poništi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Undo the last move. If the previous player is played by the computer two "
"moves are taken back so that it is the player's turn again."
msgstr ""
"Poništi zadnji potez. Ako je prethodni igrač računar, poništena su dva "
"poteza, tako da je ponovo na redu igrač."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Vrati</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replay a move which had been undone. If one of the players is played by the "
"computer two moves are redone so that it is the player's turn again."
msgstr ""
"Ponovi potez koji je bio poništen. Ako je jedan od igrača računar, "
"ponovljena su dva poteza, tako da je ponovo na redu igrač."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>H</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Potez</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pomoć</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The computer will calculate the best possible move for you and mark it with "
"a sign on the game board. How good the move actually is depends on the level "
"of the computer."
msgstr ""
"Računar će odrediti koji je najbolji mogući potez koji možete napraviti i "
"označiti ga na ploči za igru. Koliko je to dobar potez, zapravo zavisi od "
"nivoa računara."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Tema</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose a graphical theme for the game. Which themes are available depends on "
"the current installation."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite grafičku temu za igru. Koje teme su dostupne zavisi od trenutne "
"instalacije."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Network Configuration...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguracija mreže...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pops up a dialog for the network configuration. You can choose to be server "
"or client. If you are server you can also choose what color the remote "
"player should take over. If a network game is running you can also "
"disconnect it in this menu."
msgstr ""
"Iskoči dijalog za konfiguraciju mreže. Možete odabrati želite li biti "
"poslužitelj ili klijent. Ako ste poslužitelj, također možete odabrati i koju "
"boju bi udaljeni igrač trebao preuzeti. Ako je pokrenuta mrežna igra, "
"također možete odspojiti vezu u ovom izborniku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kappname; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kappname; ima zajedničke &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Izbornik "
"postavki</ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Izbornik pomoći</ulink> od &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kfourinline; can be configured using the configuration dialog with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&kfourinline;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"&kfourinline; može se konfigurisati koristeći konfiguracijski dijalog sa "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši "
"&kfourinline;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Starting Player Color</guilabel>: Determine which player color "
"(<guilabel>Red</guilabel> or <guilabel>Black</guilabel>) has the first move "
"in the next game."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Boja igrača koji započinje igru</guilabel>: Odredite koja boja "
"igrača (<guilabel>Crvena</guilabel> ili <guilabel>Crna</guilabel>) ima prvi "
"potez u slijedećoj igri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Player Names</guilabel>: Change the names of the players."
msgstr "<guilabel>Imena igrača</guilabel>: Promijeni imena igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Black Plays With</guilabel>: Choose who should play for player 1. "
"It can be either <guilabel>Mouse</guilabel> or <guilabel>Keyboard</"
"guilabel>, &ie; a local player using the mouse or keyboard as input device "
"or <guilabel>Computer</guilabel>, &ie; the computer plays for this player."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Crni igra sa</guilabel>: Odaberite ko bi trebao igrati za igrača "
"1. To može biti ili <guilabel>Miš</guilabel> ili <guilabel>Tastatura</"
"guilabel>, &ie; lokalni igrač koristeći miš ili tastaturu kao ulazni uređaj "
"ili <guilabel>Računar</guilabel>, &ie; računar igra za ovog igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Red Plays With</guilabel>: Same as <guilabel>Black Plays With</"
"guilabel> but for player 2 (red)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Crveni igra sa</guilabel>: Isto kao i <guilabel>Crni igra sa</"
"guilabel> ali za igrača 2 (crveni)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Computer Difficulty</guilabel>: Select the level of the computer "
"player."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Težina računara</guilabel>: Odaberite nivo računara kao igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Use AI learning</guilabel>: The computer AI can learn from "
"mistakes made in one game."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristite Al učenje</guilabel>: Računar Al može učiti iz grešaka "
"koje su napravljene u jednoj igri."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I change the look of the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li promijeniti izgled igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the color of the pieces by opening the <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> menu and select <guisubmenu>Theme</guisubmenu>."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti boju dijelova otvaranjem <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"izbornika i biranjem <guisubmenu>Tema</guisubmenu>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot use the keyboard to control the pieces."
msgstr "Ne možete koristiti tastaturu da upravljate dijelovima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have lost control of who is in the lead, can I find it out?"
msgstr "Izgubio sam kontrolu nad tim ko je u vodstvu, mogu li to saznati?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, you can see statistics by opening the <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu and "
"selecting <guimenuitem>Show Statistics</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Da, možete vidjeti statistike otvaranjem <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> izbornika i "
"biranjem <guimenuitem>Prikaži statistike</guimenuitem>."

